        "value": "但シ知事一人並ニ家族四人合テ五人差引殘如上ニ候事"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "但し、知事一人ならびに家族四人、合わせて五人を差し引き、残りは上のごとくに候ふこと"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Note: subtracting the governor (1 person) together with his family (4 persons), 5 persons in all, the remainder is as shown above."
